#: scenario8:scenario8_538603F2_DF0F_4375_93D4_E9F2786EFA69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6937c4c074fb67ad77715710d19300d19fb87ce5bdbe4d02990588d8fce6f056
#. default-sha256: c4d206bc866ad9b93e03499834992e154753194dc0023c3b12e3f757b9f36168
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_538603F2_DF0F_4375_93D4_E9F2786EFA69"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫When he takes the necklace, Jacopo looks as though he’s on the "
"verge of tears."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫他收下首饰，⟪k:7⟫表情潸然欲泣。⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫即便如此，⟪k:10⟫他也没"
"有流下一滴眼泪——"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B0BC1945_691B_4EF0_AC20_A025AC10EF48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 800d5702edf61417ebcc451e3dca4680e0beda421b8fa299df8728d33981ab32
#. default-sha256: c4c60b4e05f0e2fbad3055e1dd3ab67de8dff67094ad9c62242478ce8172b7a2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B0BC1945_691B_4EF0_AC20_A025AC10EF48"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whether from the pressure of not wanting to lose face, or simply because he’s no longer able "
"to, he doesn’t actually shed any, though."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫那是因为，⟪k:1⟫他依旧非常在意别人的眼光呢——⟪k:2⟫还是因为，⟪k:3⟫他已经不允许自己流泪了呢……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9DACE528_5CF3_410D_A06C_DFDBE77E8496
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce96b5887269194cbf9947fa82b15c63ba78e472b3f35c8d206997f0317096dc
#. default-sha256: 6ec77ab650f94fd85052176391222f970591cc2b9978356ebe7a2be2f2d119c1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9DACE528_5CF3_410D_A06C_DFDBE77E8496"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The other two just stand and watch him quietly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫其他二人，⟪k:1⟫都默默地守望着这一切。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……他们并没有看到雅各布的过去——"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9E494A6D_9D0A_4A0A_B295_7EAC70594827
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb9052383cdc4af853ed15b4f14936c0aa45cc4697bc679751586535e61442e3
#. default-sha256: 702100e17a0db6872658629ffadce3a034e21d6ed7ef67c66f4df76eb8a18e85
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9E494A6D_9D0A_4A0A_B295_7EAC70594827"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Neither of them saw the vision of his past, but they don’t pry either."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫却并没有过问。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A65628ED_B3F4_4482_8AA8_AB8B6F5FBA83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ff1474dcd04f38bda1daddc3fdf19b7956c77af5114373a31cbe5f37f18496c
#. default-sha256: e961d8e0e044382a8690b8544d48fef6295ce3c685dcbd97825ad3a5406082c3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A65628ED_B3F4_4482_8AA8_AB8B6F5FBA83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Our exchange was probably sufficient to give them an idea of what happened, even if they "
"don’t know the details."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫就算不清楚细节——⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫应该也能从我和他的对话中，⟪k:3⟫感受到他有怎样的过去。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4331D23C_A965_432D_BF48_DCF3CB7E5BB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fdd7a26f1876e8f9bec293dcf57596ca68f1945a1288b711eddffe121df9c5d4
#. default-sha256: a2f99ac1370746841748034c50b720a2f043671c769db3f7fd628b10e3290e33
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4331D23C_A965_432D_BF48_DCF3CB7E5BB4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Clutching the necklace in one hand, Jacopo takes up the head of the procession to the "
"observation tower."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫雅各布把首饰攥在手中，⟪k:1⟫引领着我们，⟪k:2⟫走向瞭望塔。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E1DFF7A8_FE7F_4E19_8D0A_6122F084BA4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 743e1b4c9a6265d9397ab500cbf3b2397b90b4a91f5e07020198c466dc48cffa
#. default-sha256: f1cb2e667365978bfe24011e7c90144bc9f21685b2dc37399e671305c180f2d5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E1DFF7A8_FE7F_4E19_8D0A_6122F084BA4D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And while it lasts but for a brief moment,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽然只有短暂的一瞬——"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C5189E0F_0867_4E32_95DB_CBC3BCFDF31D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d5c1fb8be88e162c01b22a852912b53d2818f70de99840fc2ff1bb41d9cd21e
#. default-sha256: b62342acd9a9a3ec719732abfcc29a75f571e5e518d57835c577f3fdb78b3559
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C5189E0F_0867_4E32_95DB_CBC3BCFDF31D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I see an image of the young man he used to be in his slightly slouched shoulders."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫可他的背影还是和曾经的青年重叠在一起。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_EFE9D80D_62E2_4FAD_8C40_48885718C854
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa9b4c1aa105232feccb4cf3df10af5389dc5ff43c11fad0cda1592ac62bc415
#. default-sha256: d7815bc8b6a16cc043abdfa6db628d1feebdae07f8081c4af96bbf354af7ef4e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EFE9D80D_62E2_4FAD_8C40_48885718C854"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫They "
"each insert and turn their individual keys,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫所有钥匙"
"都齐全了——"

#: scenario8:scenario8_78C4A1AD_06F0_404A_A911_289C2D1A8545
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1bcf7d61eaa0367e45544e35e1ced2e17e0674ebb4eecc3ab6ae6131b501c732
#. default-sha256: 55e15a61afe14a31c6adb4b31c5e1cd8460fd9b105c9130bce3c79d9793bafb0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_78C4A1AD_06F0_404A_A911_289C2D1A8545"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the lock disengaging and the door giving a deep groan as it swings open."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫随着沉重的声音，⟪k:1⟫门打开了。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_23F4E655_115E_47D8_81D4_32424412E816
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a12d9fd3307a23c12e2912ae521637dd221b3ac44dbc863e54d468f2d5475aea
#. default-sha256: aa4f7b020a16ab654b73f847a7ff17d60bd62350adc9c699b9e898989d9280d2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_23F4E655_115E_47D8_81D4_32424412E816"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Beyond it, a spiral staircase extends high into the sky."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫门内，⟪k:3⟫是向上延伸的螺旋阶梯。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_039FE425_1400_4CF4_91E9_3587DDD3BA30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b4e44a89727ac813281241d81cd14e700af9b0b5e7fb2245350861a3a11bc1e3
#. default-sha256: 1bc8b20897f8695370d3067aab3ebc3ef06b6861f079bb472b6dc35a73b9a176
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_039FE425_1400_4CF4_91E9_3587DDD3BA30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Every time I’ve climbed these stairs, it’s always been a solemn affair—⟪k:1⟫and now is no "
"different."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫不管何时，⟪k:1⟫每当登上这段楼梯……我心中都会十分沉重。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫现在这个瞬间，⟪k:4⟫也不例外。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_2940BC09_DF88_414F_83CD_7E63A3C23521
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 127b264892d71d5d40f6143c68a66bc63ab72825677e0c6671a77e02a407c089
#. default-sha256: 6aaa0ebbf91982e31065d22abf27ccb776a02721f02563be9d8fbaf0526bb541
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2940BC09_DF88_414F_83CD_7E63A3C23521"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’ve succeeded, though. I’ve got them all here,⟪k:1⟫ready to set her free before she’s "
"supposed to die."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫可是——⟪k:1⟫我已经赶在了莫尔加娜死前。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫她是在明天正午迎接死亡——"

#: scenario8:scenario8_1A5A083C_156A_46D0_A0BC_EED6903904BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3607aefd98b3f812242f680e1ae0794550567104c7556d59864df30e65fc1da9
#. default-sha256: f1daa4a364c9482984941c66bff1307999e455810a4fc92f4caaf62393d65385
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1A5A083C_156A_46D0_A0BC_EED6903904BE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I have changed the past."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫而我——⟪k:1⟫颠覆了这一切……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F9A6BD9D_1C88_4277_B45E_8C335670875A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 654416e6259f69c436a12a96601ff4ce494c917ee171d4862afdd809a4bf537d
#. default-sha256: 35e7889cd29c1eb3041c4b17f1bee151148963527aa815c9258668154bb3a0d8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F9A6BD9D_1C88_4277_B45E_8C335670875A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Giselle..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……吉赛儿……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_33743BC5_AF6A_473E_8843_257470755545
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18358dece3818d2ba2a960516f3fa43fc35289371140bf032a939018ab739d5a
#. default-sha256: 28ed340d9236666cdb63b9ef0afb9a04c28d06fc80a0176831a980e525ce3ec9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_33743BC5_AF6A_473E_8843_257470755545"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Can you hear me, Giselle?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I made it in time..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫吉赛儿，⟪k:2⟫你听我说……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫我赶上了……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4B81E828_6EC6_45D6_8382_0A7C6458FC9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ec94e62cfc76cc03cc79b2471a0f1a4c9519c4f58246846ae42f4158594552a
#. default-sha256: a69e4452405d490ad1de202f7a65b0c61ed01ed324101042959e967d1ae98dc2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4B81E828_6EC6_45D6_8382_0A7C6458FC9F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Now Morgana doesn’t have to die tomorrow..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……这下莫尔加娜就不会死去了……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_3A15591A_25A6_44B6_ADFF_A459432D8302
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a4a00307c61252a798f19bd408b50afa8ed5d3146dcabb5a2fd83f839d43499
#. default-sha256: d203d202967cafcb5fa364e7189b076bbc749c449b858aae21da12bf6a7724dd
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3A15591A_25A6_44B6_ADFF_A459432D8302"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I did it..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……赶上了……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B4D4045F_123A_4C55_8D4D_6D1CB19B18B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd653412a569ef42563c6f7a50901e39e6e5de41ae2feb1ef1945f0d515b442f
#. default-sha256: 35e7889cd29c1eb3041c4b17f1bee151148963527aa815c9258668154bb3a0d8
